{title: Hungama Hai Kyon Barpa}
{artist: Ghulam Ali}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Hungama Hai [C]Kyon Barpa,
[C]Thodi Si Jo [Dm]Pii Lii Hai
[Dm]Daakaa Toh Nahin Daalaa
[Dm]Chori Toh [C]Nahi Kii Hai
[Dm]Naa [A#]Tajurbakaari Se
[A]Baais Kii [Dm]Ye Baatein Hai
[Dm]Is Rang Ko Kyaa Jaane
[Dm]Puchho Toh [C]Kabhi Pii Hai
[Dm]Us Mai [A#]Se Nahi Matlab,
[A]Dil Jis [Dm]se Hai Begaanaa
[Dm]Maqasudd Hai Us Mai Se
[Dm]Dil Hii Mein [C]Jo Khinchati Hai
[Dm]Vaa Dil Mein [A#]Ki Sadame Do
[A]Yaa Kee Mein [Dm]Ke Sab Sah Lo
[Dm]Unkaa Bhi Ajab Dil Hai
[Dm]Mera Bhi [C]Ajab Jii Hai
[Dm]Har Zarra [A#]Chamaktaa Hai
[C]Anwaar-e-Ilaahi [Dm]Se
[Dm]Har Saans Ye Kehati Hai
[Dm]Hum Hai To [C]Khuda Bhi Hai
[Dm]Suraj Mein [A#]Lage Dhabba
[C]Fitrat ke [Dm]Karishme hain
[Dm]But Hum ko Kahein Kaafir
[Dm]Allah Ki [C]Marzi Hai
